            "review_title": "Review at Gáo Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Phương Nhi\nQuang Tri Province, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nA Relaxing Evening With Great Flavors\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWe had a wonderful dinner here during our Hanoi trip. The atmosphere was peaceful and the food had some really lovely flavors. We especially enjoyed how fresh and authentic the dishes tasted. The restaurant was a great place to slow down after a busy day of sightseeing. The service was friendly and attentive as well. One of the nicer evenings we had during our vacation.\nWritten September 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
